OL,3,GNEWSADo not miss school for GTA 6,
OL,4,Apupils told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham head teacher has warned
OL,7,Fparents not to let children miss school
OL,8,Fto play Grand Theft Auto 6 (GTA 6)
OL,9,Ffollowing the game's launch.
OL,11,FRashel Rahman, head teacher at Shenley
OL,12,FAcademy in Weoley Castle, wrote to
OL,13,Ffamilies after students told staff they
OL,14,Fwere considering taking Thursday off to
OL,15,Fplay the long-awaited game.
OL,17,FHe described GTA 6 as "the enemy" for
OL,18,Feducators and said he had concerns
OL,19,Fabout children being exposed to its
OL,20,Fviolent content.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
